Package: CBAMMR
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Bayesian and Advanced Meta-Analysis Methods in R
Version: 7.0.0
Date: 2025-10-27
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mahmood", "Developer", email = "mahmood726@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Claude", "AI", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: A comprehensive framework for conducting advanced meta-analyses with
    pairwise effect size calculation, transportability weighting, Hartung-Knapp-Sidik-Jonkman
    adjustments, prediction intervals, publication bias assessment (PET-PEESE, selection models,
    RoBMA), robust variance estimation (CR2 RVE), multivariate meta-analysis with correlation
    sensitivity, rare-events methods (Peto OR, Mantel-Haenszel, GLMM), Bayesian model averaging
    with stacking, meta-regression with natural splines, machine learning heterogeneity analysis,
    and comprehensive diagnostic tools. Supports hazard ratios (HR), risk ratios (RR), odds ratios
    (OR), risk differences (RD), mean differences (MD), and standardized mean differences (SMD).
